Subject: [PATCH] Experimental: rooms can keep the host's FireRed/LeafGreen or
 Ruby/Sapphire port native

With the launcher switch on, a hosted room shares the host's own native save with the PC boxes cleared instead of an Emerald rebuild, and a guest finds the room's ROM in the launcher's ROM folder. The guest's team still plays as Emerald. Off by default.

